OL,3,GNEWSATop national prize for Korean
OL,4,Abarbecue restaurant
OL,5,
OL,6,FA family-owned Korean restaurant has
OL,7,Fbeen named as the best in the UK,
OL,8,Fwinning #100,000 alongside the title.
OL,10,FJinseon Korean Barbecue, based in
OL,11,FPriory Place, Coventry, is run by Ken
OL,12,FTsang, his wife, Camay and her brother,
OL,13,FJames Kwong.
OL,15,FIt was chosen from 45 eateries across
OL,16,Fthe country and named Restaurant of the
OL,17,FYear by the delivery firm, Uber Eats.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
