OL,3,GNEWSATop national prize for Korean
OL,4,Abarbecue restaurant
OL,5,
OL,6,FTsang said: "This award isn't just
OL,7,Frecognition for our food, but for the
OL,8,Fhard work of our whole team and the
OL,9,Fsupport of our community. The #100,000
OL,10,Fprize will allow us to expand our
OL,11,Fbusiness and we can't wait to take the
OL,12,Fnext step in our journey."
